  - Draft a concise slide (or an email summary) with the recommended finance narrative and the KPI table for execs and investors.
- I can also draft the explanation for the board/finance pack reconciling runway vs burn if you confirm which numbers are correct.

Which numbers can you provide now? If you want, give me:
- S&M spend (last quarter or last 12 months),
- # of new customers in the same period,
- Total active customers,
- Gross margin %,
- Churn (monthly or annual),
- Confirm the correct burn/runway figures.

I’ll compute the exact CAC/LTV and produce the slide-ready narrative.

