- Quick math: runway = cash / net burn. If net burn really is $45K/month, runway = 5.2M / 45K ≈ 115.6 months (≈9.6 years), not 14 months. To get 14 months of runway with $5.2M cash, net burn would need to be ≈ $371K/month.
