- Channel breakdown: CAC by channel (paid search, content, sales, partnerships)  
- Sensitivity analysis: LTV under different churn scenarios and impact on runway / cash needs  
- Action plan and targets (reduce CAC by X%, raise retention to Y% → projected LTV improves to Z)

7) Next steps I can do for you
