2) I can prepare a 2-slide summary (metrics + scenario table) and a short paragraph you can paste into a finance deck.
3) Build a sensitivity table (interactive scenarios) showing how CAC, LTV, LTV:CAC and payback change with churn, ARPA, and S&M spend.

Which option do you want? If #1 or #2, please provide the S&M spend and new customers (or total customers) and churn/gross margin if you have them — I’ll compute precise numbers and produce the narrative.

