1) Key formulas (simple, commonly used)
- CAC = Total Sales & Marketing spend in a period / # of new customers acquired in that period
- ARPU (monthly) = Revenue in period / # customers in period / # months in period
- Gross margin (%) = (Revenue − Cost of goods sold) / Revenue
- Monthly churn rate = % of customers lost per month
- LTV (simple cohort model) = ARPU_month * Gross_margin / Monthly_churn
