- Channel breakdown: CAC by acquisition channel (inbound, paid, sales-led).
- Sensitivity table: show LTV and payback under conservative/base/optimistic churn & CAC assumptions.
- Action items & asks: e.g., if LTV:CAC < 3 then propose measures (improve onboarding to reduce churn, increase pricing, optimize channels to reduce CAC, shift toward higher-margin product).
- Capital plan: if runway is really 14 months at higher planned burn, show when additional funding or throttling of spend is needed.

