2) What I need from you to compute CAC and LTV exactly
- Period to analyze (last quarter, last 12 months, LTM)
- Sales & Marketing spend in that period (total S&M cash spend)
- Number of new customers acquired in that same period
- Revenue per customer (ARPU) — monthly or annual; or total revenue + number of customers so we can compute ARPU
- Gross margin (as % of revenue) — e.g., 70% (important for LTV)
- Churn rate or average customer lifetime (monthly churn % or average months a customer stays)
- Business model type: subscription (SaaS) or transactional (one-off purchases)

